From: RCTools GPU audit
Subject: [PATCH EXPERIMENTAL] X11: use GL_MESA_pack_invert for eglkgsl readback

Base: VirtualGL/virtualgl 2473cf39bdbe88ca41ecd58ac4007385c9682a9f

For the eglkgsl X11-proxy path only, request top-down pixel packing when the
OpenGL context exposes GL_MESA_pack_invert.  This avoids the full-frame CPU
fbx_flip() performed by FBXFrame::redraw().  Mono X11 proxy frames only are
affected.  Other transports, stereo paths, and drivers retain the existing
FRAME_BOTTOMUP behavior.  If the extension is unavailable at runtime, the
code automatically falls back to the original CPU flip.

This patch is source-build validated only.  Real-device visual orientation,
performance, resize, and gamma-correction tests are required before use.

